{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible: move to it, take, check properties, perform task, release; else avoid obstacles or randomly move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = RandomMovement    /> <Action ID = ReleaseObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
